                {
                  "identifier": "f836c7b7-f7ae-4d12-b251-c4db1c5ebd3b",
                  "type": "ETG.Web.Widget.HtmlTextWidget",
                  "variants": [
                    {
                      "identifier": "5ef65eb9-ea68-40b3-b42d-406ca088c055",
                      "properties": { "text": "<h2 class=\"text-left\">3. Gelato</h2>\r\n <p>You say, ‘ice cream,’ the Italians say, ‘gelato.’ This beloved dessert is softer than ice cream but rich in flavour. It has a high density because of its higher proportion of milk, and it’s churned slowly. Having far less fat than your average ice cream, you can have a scoop after each meal without the guilt. Grab a cone when you visit Florence, Rome, or Venice.</p>" }
                    }
                  ]
